text:
@moranmikey Everything we do is risky, SCHD is risky as well............anyting in the stock market can go down...........but we eat garbage food and continue to do so even though its risky.........we drive vehicles and their is a risk of a accident or death every single time............I could go on, but everything is pretty much a risk................

But lets not even look at QQQI, put it in QQQM, VOO, or many others............so many ETFs better than SCHD, people are afriad to sell a stock to get their "Income" I dont know why........if I can make 50-60K more on the same amount of money you dont have to sell much to get your 1000 of income and still have a bunch left over..............People are on the SCHD train because of youtube......so many average people not understanding what they are doing, they relay on someone telling to buy SCHD, they see a dividend check and are happy, then they see the stock price go up a bit and get happy......in the meantime they aren't learning that etfs like VGT have paid significantly higher over that same time frame.......

So many on youtube want you to buy certains stocks because they are invested in it, you pile in money and their investment increases......they can dump and leave you holding the bag...........BUYER BEWARE...........But, its smart to educate yourself, there are a ton of videos on youtube about the stock market, do your resarch but I rather make 15% or more per year on average in a growth ETF than be in a dividend etf paying less than 3.5% and crossing my fingers that it goes up...........
